{
  "duration": 53.499,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 2.939,
      "text": "So welcome back again. Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.419,
      "end": 5.619,
      "text": "Now in this problem, we are given that a bus covers"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.119,
      "end": 8.019,
      "text": "one hundred sixty-eight kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.439,
      "end": 11.699,
      "text": "at a uniform speed of fifty-six kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.279,
      "end": 15.019,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the time taken by the bus."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.479,
      "end": 15.899,
      "text": "Now, first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 17.919,
      "text": "let us note down the given values."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.459,
      "end": 21.76,
      "text": "Distance covered by the bus is one hundred sixty-eight kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.359,
      "end": 25.159,
      "text": "Speed of the bus is fifty-six kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.739,
      "end": 26.699,
      "text": "Now we know the formula,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.319,
      "end": 30.459,
      "text": "time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.879,
      "end": 31.299,
      "text": "Got it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.76,
      "end": 32.199,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.88,
      "end": 35.579,
      "text": "Now let us put the given values into the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.139,
      "end": 40.899,
      "text": "Time taken by the bus is equal to total distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.379,
      "end": 45.439,
      "text": "That is equal to one hundred sixty-eight divided by fifty-six."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.079,
      "end": 48.159,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.639,
      "end": 50.699,
      "text": "So the time taken by the bus is three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.039,
      "end": 53.499,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option A."
    }
  ],
